{
  "task_id": "TASK-001",
  "task": "阶梯满减",
  "specs": [
    {
      "spec_id": "SPEC-PRICING-102",
      "title": "阶梯满减（本次任务要实现的目标行为）",
      "body": "- 阶梯门槛按**会员折扣之后的小计**判断（即 `discounted_subtotal`）。\n- 折扣率口径与会员折扣一致，均为“减去的比例”（`0.15` 表示减 15%）。\n- 折扣档位（只取最高一档，不叠加）：\n\n  | `discounted_subtotal` 门槛 | 满减折扣率 | 折后系数 |\n  | --- | --- | --- |\n  | `>= 10000` | `0.15` | `0.85` |\n  | `>= 5000` | `0.10` | `0.90` |\n  | `>= 1000` | `0.05` | `0.95` |\n  | `< 1000` | `0`（不打折） | `1` |\n\n- 门槛是**闭区间**：`discounted_subtotal` 恰好等于 `1000` 时适用 `0.05`。\n- 阶梯满减同样只作用于商品小计，不作用于运费与税额。",
      "source_path": "specs/SPEC-001-pricing.md",
      "source_line": 13,
      "revision": 3,
      "content_hash": "7641cb52596d768c43f42090a828bae8",
      "tags": [
        "PRICING",
        "目标行为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "spec_id": "SPEC-PRICING-103",
      "title": "叠加顺序",
      "body": "- 计算顺序固定为：\n  1. 计算商品小计 `subtotal`；\n  2. 应用会员折扣，得到 `discounted_subtotal`；\n  3. 用 `discounted_subtotal` 判断阶梯满减档位，得到 `tier_rate`；\n  4. 最终商品金额 `= 会员折后小计 × (1 - tier_rate)`。\n- 会员折扣与阶梯满减不得互相抵消，也不得各自作用于不同的小计口径。",
      "source_path": "specs/SPEC-001-pricing.md",
      "source_line": 29,
      "revision": 1,
      "content_hash": "2f2cc5c3b704048397c84f79684d5a4c",
      "tags": [
        "PRICING"
      ]
    },
    {
      "spec_id": "SPEC-COMPAT-401",
      "title": "既有公开函数签名",
      "body": "下列函数必须继续以相同名称与签名存在：\n\n| 函数 | 模块 | 约束 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `subtotal(order)` | `order_pricing.discounts` | 返回商品小计 |\n| `member_discount_rate(order)` | `order_pricing.discounts` | 返回会员折扣率 |\n| `member_discounted_subtotal(order)` | `order_pricing.discounts` | 返回会员折后小计 |\n| `tiered_discount_rate(discounted_subtotal)` | `order_pricing.discounts` | 返回阶梯满减折扣率 |\n| `apply_discounts(order)` | `order_pricing.discounts` | 返回 `DiscountResult` |\n| `shipping_fee(order, discounted_subtotal)` | `order_pricing.shipping` | 返回运费 |\n| `invoice_total(order)` | `order_pricing.invoice` | 返回 `Invoice` |\n| `quantize(amount)` | `order_pricing.money` | 两位小数 `ROUND_HALF_UP` |",
      "source_path": "specs/SPEC-003-compatibility.md",
      "source_line": 7,
      "revision": 1,
      "content_hash": "1efe9639d612ae8b69a84ea715bdd9f1",
      "tags": [
        "COMPAT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "spec_id": "SPEC-PRICING-105",
      "title": "结果可读性",
      "body": "- 计价结果必须同时暴露：商品小计、会员折扣率、阶梯满减折扣率、最终折后小计，\n  以便上层展示与测试断言。",
      "source_path": "specs/SPEC-001-pricing.md",
      "source_line": 43,
      "revision": 1,
      "content_hash": "854c49539e44040eb3832cda0d12db8b",
      "tags": [
        "PRICING"
      ]
    }
  ],
